flowchart TD
    NOTE["PROPOSED PROJECT WATCHDOG<br/>simulated monotonic time; no MCU equivalence"]
    INIT["Enable with default 2000 ms<br/>set last service + deadline"]
    PROG["Coordinator reaches service checkpoint"]
    SUP{"Fault injection suppresses service?"}
    SERVICE["Update last service and deadline"]
    ADV["Harness advances logical clock"]
    EXP{"Deadline reached?"}
    REQ["Emit exactly one watchdog reset request"]
    OFF["Clear outputs and expiry"]
    CLEAR["Clear transient state;<br/>preserve config, credentials, event history"]
    LOG["Append watchdog_reset/reset/watchdog_timeout"]
    REINIT["Reinitialize watchdog and return IDLE"]
    LOGFAIL["On append failure expose logging_error;<br/>reset still completes"]

    NOTE --> INIT --> PROG --> SUP
    SUP -- no --> SERVICE --> ADV
    SUP -- yes --> ADV
    ADV --> EXP
    EXP -- no --> PROG
    EXP -- yes --> REQ --> OFF --> CLEAR --> LOG --> REINIT
    LOG -. failure .-> LOGFAIL --> REINIT

